OL,3,ABurnham cancels engagements after death
OL,4,Aof father
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is
OL,7,Funderstood to have cancelled
OL,8,Fengagements for Monday and Tuesday
OL,9,Ffollowing the death of his father Roy.
OL,11,FBurnham has previously spoken about his
OL,12,Ffather, who had Alzheimer's, when
OL,13,Fexplaining why he was so determined to
OL,14,Freform adult social care in England.
OL,16,FHe also revealed his father did not
OL,17,Fknow he had become prime minister in
OL,18,FJuly, because of his condition.
OL,20,FThe PM was due to host a meeting of
OL,21,Fbusiness leaders in Downing Street
OL,22,Flater.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
